From cbe74a71b3cadd83b95d7f8b826741f329bf5292 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Nishant Sharma <nishant.sharma@arm.com>
Date: Fri, 5 Jan 2024 17:17:54 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] neoverse-rd/rdv3 add pcie_setup config file

This enables the support for pcie_setup module by adding the relavent
configuration information and adding the module for RD-V3 scp_ram
firmware.

Signed-off-by: Nishant Sharma <nishant.sharma@arm.com>
Change-Id: Idb9be3419a9f99053ed1864e4c329b540ebe37eb

Signed-off-by: Jon Mason <jon.mason@arm.com>
Upstream-Status: Pending
